WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From forearm Down Dog, walk the feet back.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Align shoulders over elbows in a long line.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Engage the belly and legs.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Gaze slightly forward of the hands.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold, then lower the knees to rest.
